        <li><a href="#what" class="hover:underline">What a COPR is and what it shows</a></li>
        <li><a href="#in-canada" class="hover:underline">Getting your eCOPR from inside Canada</a></li>
        <li><a href="#outside" class="hover:underline">Getting your COPR from outside Canada</a></li>
        <li><a href="#validity" class="hover:underline">COPR validity and expiry</a></li>
