        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/permanent-residents/status/copr.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Confirmation of Permanent Residence document, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/pr-confirmation-portal.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Confirm your permanent residence from within Canada, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/express-entry/application-approved.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">If your Express Entry application is approved, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/express-entry/application-approved/in-canada.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">If we approve your application: In Canada, IRCC</a></li>
